{"id":"23b1cc8e-a9dd-4499-aa70-a51945a510fc","name":"Nested Task Management Website","displayName":"Nested Task Management Website","summary":"","created":"2025-06-05T02:02:39.842313Z","updated":"2025-06-05T02:04:58.802591Z","messages":[{"id":"bc9cf14d-a5c3-43bb-b51d-158fca9d4241","sender":"human","ts":"2025-06-05T02:02:43.469170Z","blocks":[{"k":"text","md":"TASK：\n1. build a website using html, css, javascript, the style using apple design style\n2. The aim of the website is for breaking down one task to a nested task list which is both numbered list, todo list and toggle list.  each breaked subtask has a order which means the priority, each breaked subtask is a todo list with a select box at front, you can select to mean done (at the same time the center strikethrough will appear in the subtask), each breaked subtask is also a toggle list which you can break down the subtask to subsubtasks which each element is bost both numbered list, todo list and toggle list. notice in each task/subtask/subsubtask... we can set a time deadline.\n3. at home page, we have number/page view of each task and create button. we can rename the task. delete the task, and click the task to modify the task. we can create task using create button\n4. at task page, wen have title, description, created date, modified date, nested tasks, stastics info and progress bar \n   1. nested tasks is described in the aim of the website. notice in each task/subtask/subsubtask... we can set a time deadline.\n   2. stastics info including total number of first level tasks, total number of second level tasks and .... as well as stastics info including finished number of first level tasks, number of second level tasks and ....  \n   3. we can visualize progress bar which means finished/total of each level."}],"attachments":[],"toolResults":[],"toolResultOnly":false,"files":[],"parent":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000"},{"id":"b002d496-af5e-49eb-b775-59796e32976f","sender":"assistant","ts":"2025-06-05T02:04:49.325876Z","blocks":[{"k":"text","md":" I'll create a comprehensive task breakdown website with Apple design aesthetics. This will be a fully functional single-page application with nested task management capabilities."},{"k":"tool","name":"artifacts","kind":"artifact","label":"创建了 %n 个工件","input":{"id":"task-breakdown-app","type":"text/html","title":"Task Breakdown Manager - Apple Style","command":"create","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Task Breakdown Manager</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f7fa 0%, #c3cfe2 100%);\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            color: #1d1d1f;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .header {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n            padding: 40px 0;\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n        }\n\n        .header h1 {\n            font-size: 3rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);\n            -webkit-background-clip: text;\n            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n\n        .header p {\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            color: #86868b;\n        }\n\n        .home-view, .task-view {\n            display: none;\n        }\n\n        .home-view.active, .task-view.active {\n            display: block;\n        }\n\n        .create-button {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #007aff 0%, #0056cc 100%);\n            color: white;\n            border: none;\n            padding: 15px 30px;\n            border-radius: 25px;\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 122, 255, 0.3);\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n        }\n\n        .create-button:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 122, 255, 0.4);\n        }\n\n        .task-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));\n            gap: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .task-card {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            padding: 24px;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            cursor: pointer;\n        }\n\n        .task-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }\n\n        .task-card-header {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n\n        .task-title {\n            font-size: 1.3rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: #1d1d1f;\n        }\n\n        .task-actions {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n\n        .action-btn {\n            background: none;\n            border: none;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            padding: 8px;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            transition: all 0.2s ease;\n        }\n\n        .action-btn:hover {\n            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }\n\n        .task-meta {\n            color: #86868b;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n\n        .progress-bar {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 8px;\n            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n            border-radius: 4px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n\n        .progress-fill {\n            height: 100%;\n            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #34c759 0%, #30d158 100%);\n            transition: width 0.3s ease;\n        }\n\n        .back-button {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n            color: #007aff;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 122, 255, 0.3);\n            padding: 10px 20px;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .back-button:hover {\n            background: rgba(0, 122, 255, 0.1);\n        }\n\n        .task-detail {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            padding: 30px;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);\n        }\n\n        .task-detail-header {\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n        }\n\n        .task-detail-title {\n            font-size: 2.5rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n            color: #1d1d1f;\n        }\n\n        .task-description {\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n            color: #86868b;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n\n        .task-dates {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 30px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .date-info {\n            color: #86868b;\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n        }\n\n        .date-info strong {\n            color: #1d1d1f;\n        }\n\n        .statistics {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));\n            gap: 20px;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n        }\n\n        .stat-card {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            padding: 20px;\n            text-align: center;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);\n        }\n\n        .stat-number {\n            font-size: 2rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #007aff;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .stat-label {\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            color: #86868b;\n        }\n\n        .nested-tasks {\n            margin-top: 30px;\n        }\n\n        .nested-tasks h3 {\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: #1d1d1f;\n        }\n\n        .task-item {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            padding: 15px;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n        }\n\n        .task-item:hover {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);\n        }\n\n        .task-item-header {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 15px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n        }\n\n        .task-checkbox {\n            width: 20px;\n            height: 20px;\n            border: 2px solid #007aff;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: all 0.2s ease;\n        }\n\n        .task-checkbox.checked {\n            background: #007aff;\n            color: white;\n        }\n\n        .task-number {\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: #007aff;\n            min-width: 30px;\n        }\n\n        .task-content {\n            flex: 1;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n        }\n\n        .task-text {\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n        }\n\n        .task-text.completed {\n            text-decoration: line-through;\n            opacity: 0.6;\n        }\n\n        .task-deadline {\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\n            color: #86868b;\n            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n            padding: 4px 8px;\n            border-radius: 6px;\n        }\n\n        .toggle-btn {\n            background: none;\n            border: none;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            padding: 5px;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n            transition: all 0.2s ease;\n        }\n\n        .toggle-btn:hover {\n            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }\n\n        .subtasks {\n            margin-left: 40px;\n            margin-top: 15px;\n            display: none;\n        }\n\n        .subtasks.show {\n            display: block;\n        }\n\n        .add-subtask-btn {\n            background: rgba(0, 122, 255, 0.1);\n            color: #007aff;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 122, 255, 0.3);\n            padding: 10px 15px;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            margin-top: 10px;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n        }\n\n        .add-subtask-btn:hover {\n            background: rgba(0, 122, 255, 0.2);\n        }\n\n        .modal {\n            display: none;\n            position: fixed;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);\n            z-index: 1000;\n        }\n\n        .modal.show {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n        }\n\n        .modal-content {\n            background: white;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            padding: 30px;\n            max-width: 500px;\n            width: 90%;\n            max-height: 80vh;\n            overflow-y: auto;\n        }\n\n        .modal-header {\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: #1d1d1f;\n        }\n\n        .form-group {\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .form-group label {\n            display: block;\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            color: #1d1d1f;\n        }\n\n        .form-group input,\n        .form-group textarea {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 12px 16px;\n            border: 1px solid #d1d1d6;\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n        }\n\n        .form-group input:focus,\n        .form-group textarea:focus {\n            outline: none;\n            border-color: #007aff;\n            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(0, 122, 255, 0.1);\n        }\n\n        .form-group textarea {\n            min-height: 100px;\n            resize: vertical;\n        }\n\n        .modal-actions {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 15px;\n            justify-content: flex-end;\n            margin-top: 30px;\n        }\n\n        .btn {\n            padding: 12px 24px;\n            border: none;\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n        }\n\n        .btn-primary {\n            background: #007aff;\n            color: white;\n        }\n\n        .btn-primary:hover {\n            background: #0056cc;\n        }\n\n        .btn-secondary {\n            background: #f2f2f7;\n            color: #1d1d1f;\n        }\n\n        .btn-secondary:hover {\n            background: #e5e5ea;\n        }\n\n        .level-progress {\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .level-progress h4 {\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n            color: #1d1d1f;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .container {\n                padding: 10px;\n            }\n\n            .header h1 {\n                font-size: 2rem;\n            }\n\n            .task-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n\n            .task-dates {\n                flex-direction: column;\n                gap: 10px;\n            }\n\n            .statistics {\n                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"header\">\n            <h1>Task Breakdown</h1>\n            <p>Organize your work into manageable, hierarchical tasks</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Home View -->\n        <div class=\"home-view active\" id=\"homeView\">\n            <button class=\"create-button\" onclick=\"showCreateTaskModal()\">\n                ✨ Create New Task\n            </button>\n            \n            <div class=\"task-grid\" id=\"taskGrid\">\n                <!-- Tasks will be dynamically added here -->\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Task Detail View -->\n        <div class=\"task-view\" id=\"taskView\">\n            <button class=\"back-button\" onclick=\"showHomeView()\">\n                ← Back to Tasks\n            </button>\n            \n            <div class=\"task-detail\" id=\"taskDetail\">\n                <!-- Task details will be dynamically added here -->\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Create/Edit Task Modal -->\n        <div class=\"modal\" id=\"taskModal\">\n            <div class=\"modal-content\">\n                <div class=\"modal-header\" id=\"modalHeader\">Create New Task</div>\n                <form id=\"taskForm\">\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label for=\"taskTitle\">Task Title</label>\n                        <input type=\"text\" id=\"taskTitle\" required>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label for=\"taskDescription\">Description</label>\n                        <textarea id=\"taskDescription\"></textarea>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"modal-actions\">\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" onclick=\"closeModal()\">Cancel</button>\n                        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Save Task</button>\n                    </div>\n                </form>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Create Subtask Modal -->\n        <div class=\"modal\" id=\"subtaskModal\">\n            <div class=\"modal-content\">\n                <div class=\"modal-header\">Add Subtask</div>\n                <form id=\"subtaskForm\">\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label for=\"subtaskTitle\">Subtask Title</label>\n                        <input type=\"text\" id=\"subtaskTitle\" required>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label for=\"subtaskDeadline\">Deadline (optional)</label>\n                        <input type=\"date\" id=\"subtaskDeadline\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"modal-actions\">\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" onclick=\"closeModal()\">Cancel</button>\n                        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Add Subtask</button>\n                    </div>\n                </form>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // Global state\n        let tasks = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('tasks')) || [];\n        let currentTaskId = null;\n        let currentParentTask = null;\n\n        // Initialize app\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\n            renderTasks();\n        });\n\n        // Task management functions\n        function generateId() {\n            return Date.now().toString(36) + Math.random().toString(36).substr(2);\n        }\n\n        function saveToStorage() {\n            localStorage.setItem('tasks', JSON.stringify(tasks));\n        }\n\n        function createTask(title, description) {\n            const task = {\n                id: generateId(),\n                title: title,\n                description: description,\n                createdDate: new Date().toISOString(),\n                modifiedDate: new Date().toISOString(),\n                subtasks: []\n            };\n            tasks.push(task);\n            saveToStorage();\n            return task;\n        }\n\n        function createSubtask(parentTask, title, deadline = null) {\n            const subtask = {\n                id: generateId(),\n                title: title,\n                deadline: deadline,\n                completed: false,\n                subtasks: []\n            };\n            parentTask.subtasks.push(subtask);\n            saveToStorage();\n            return subtask;\n        }\n\n        function deleteTask(taskId) {\n            tasks = tasks.filter(task => task.id !== taskId);\n            saveToStorage();\n        }\n\n        function updateTask(taskId, updates) {\n            const task = tasks.find(t => t.id === taskId);\n            if (task) {\n                Object.assign(task, updates);\n                task.modifiedDate = new Date().toISOString();\n                saveToStorage();\n            }\n        }\n\n        function toggleSubtask(taskId, subtaskId, path = []) {\n            const task = tasks.find(t => t.id === taskId);\n            if (!task) return;\n\n            let current = task.subtasks;\n            for (let index of path) {\n                current = current[index].subtasks;\n            }\n            \n            const subtask = current.find(s => s.id === subtaskId);\n            if (subtask) {\n                subtask.completed = !subtask.completed;\n                saveToStorage();\n            }\n        }\n\n        function calculateProgress(subtasks) {\n            if (!subtasks.length) return 0;\n            \n            let total = 0;\n            let completed = 0;\n            \n            function countTasks(tasks) {\n                for (let task of tasks) {\n                    total++;\n                    if (task.completed) completed++;\n                    if (task.subtasks.length > 0) {\n                        countTasks(task.subtasks);\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            \n            countTasks(subtasks);\n            return total > 0 ? (completed / total) * 100 : 0;\n        }\n\n        function getStatistics(subtasks) {\n            const stats = { levels: [] };\n            \n            function analyzeTasks(tasks, level = 0) {\n                if (!stats.levels[level]) {\n                    stats.levels[level] = { total: 0, completed: 0 };\n                }\n                \n                for (let task of tasks) {\n                    stats.levels[level].total++;\n                    if (task.completed) {\n                        stats.levels[level].completed++;\n                    }\n                    \n                    if (task.subtasks.length > 0) {\n                        analyzeTasks(task.subtasks, level + 1);\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            \n            analyzeTasks(subtasks);\n            return stats;\n        }\n\n        // UI functions\n        function showHomeView() {\n            document.getElementById('homeView').classList.add('active');\n            document.getElementById('taskView').classList.remove('active');\n            renderTasks();\n        }\n\n        function showTaskView(taskId) {\n            currentTaskId = taskId;\n            document.getElementById('homeView').classList.remove('active');\n            document.getElementById('taskView').classList.add('active');\n            renderTaskDetail(taskId);\n        }\n\n        function showCreateTaskModal() {\n            document.getElementById('modalHeader').textContent = 'Create New Task';\n            document.getElementById('taskTitle').value = '';\n            document.getElementById('taskDescription').value = '';\n            document.getElementById('taskModal').classList.add('show');\n        }\n\n        function showEditTaskModal(taskId) {\n            const task = tasks.find(t => t.id === taskId);\n            if (!task) return;\n\n            document.getElementById('modalHeader').textContent = 'Edit Task';\n            document.getElementById('taskTitle').value = task.title;\n            document.getElementById('taskDescription').value = task.description;\n            currentTaskId = taskId;\n            document.getElementById('taskModal').classList.add('show');\n        }\n\n        function showSubtaskModal(parentTask) {\n            currentParentTask = parentTask;\n            document.getElementById('subtaskTitle').value = '';\n            document.getElementById('subtaskDeadline').value = '';\n            document.getElementById('subtaskModal').classList.add('show');\n        }\n\n        function closeModal() {\n            document.querySelectorAll('.modal').forEach(modal => {\n                modal.classList.remove('show');\n            });\n            currentTaskId = null;\n            currentParentTask = null;\n        }\n\n        function renderTasks() {\n            const taskGrid = document.getElementById('taskGrid');\n            taskGrid.innerHTML = '';\n\n            tasks.forEach(task => {\n                const progress = calculateProgress(task.subtasks);\n                const taskCard = document.createElement('div');\n                taskCard.className = 'task-card';\n                taskCard.innerHTML = `\n                    <div class=\"task-card-header\">\n                        <div class=\"task-title\">${task.title}</div>\n                        <div class=\"task-actions\">\n                            <button class=\"action-btn\" onclick=\"showEditTaskModal('${task.id}')\" title=\"Edit\">\n                                ✏️\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"action-btn\" onclick=\"deleteTask('${task.id}'); renderTasks();\" title=\"Delete\">\n                                🗑️\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"task-meta\">\n                        Created: ${new Date(task.createdDate).toLocaleDateString()}\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"progress-bar\">\n                        <div class=\"progress-fill\" style=\"width: ${progress}%\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"text-align: right; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #86868b; margin-top: 5px;\">\n                        ${Math.round(progress)}% Complete\n                    </div>\n                `;\n                \n                taskCard.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n                    if (!e.target.closest('.task-actions')) {\n                        showTaskView(task.id);\n                    }\n                });\n                \n                taskGrid.appendChild(taskCard);\n            });\n        }\n\n        function renderTaskDetail(taskId) {\n            const task = tasks.find(t => t.id === taskId);\n            if (!task) return;\n\n            const progress = calculateProgress(task.subtasks);\n            const stats = getStatistics(task.subtasks);\n            \n            const taskDetail = document.getElementById('taskDetail');\n            taskDetail.innerHTML = `\n                <div class=\"task-detail-header\">\n                    <div class=\"task-detail-title\">${task.title}</div>\n                    <div class=\"task-description\">${task.description || 'No description provided'}</div>\n                    <div class=\"task-dates\">\n                        <div class=\"date-info\">\n                            <strong>Created:</strong> ${new Date(task.createdDate).toLocaleDateString()}\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"date-info\">\n                            <strong>Modified:</strong> ${new Date(task.modifiedDate).toLocaleDateString()}\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"statistics\">\n                    ${stats.levels.map((level, index) => `\n                        <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                            <div class=\"stat-number\">${level.total}</div>\n                            <div class=\"stat-label\">Level ${index + 1} Tasks</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                            <div class=\"stat-number\">${level.completed}</div>\n                            <div class=\"stat-label\">Level ${index + 1} Complete</div>\n                        </div>\n                    `).join('')}\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"level-progress\">\n                    <h4>Progress by Level</h4>\n                    ${stats.levels.map((level, index) => {\n                        const levelProgress = level.total > 0 ? (level.completed / level.total) * 100 : 0;\n                        return `\n                            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n                                <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n                                    <span>Level ${index + 1}</span>\n                                    <span>${Math.round(levelProgress)}%</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"progress-bar\">\n                                    <div class=\"progress-fill\" style=\"width: ${levelProgress}%\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        `;\n                    }).join('')}\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"nested-tasks\">\n                    <h3>Tasks</h3>\n                    <button class=\"add-subtask-btn\" onclick=\"showSubtaskModal(${JSON.stringify(task).replace(/\"/g, '&quot;')})\">\n                        + Add Task\n                    </button>\n                    <div id=\"subtasksList\">\n                        ${renderSubtasks(task.subtasks, task.id)}\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            `;\n        }\n\n        function renderSubtasks(subtasks, taskId, path = []) {\n            return subtasks.map((subtask, index) => {\n                const currentPath = [...path, index];\n                const hasSubtasks = subtask.subtasks && subtask.subtasks.length > 0;\n                \n                return `\n                    <div class=\"task-item\" data-task-id=\"${subtask.id}\">\n                        <div class=\"task-item-header\">\n                            <div class=\"task-checkbox ${subtask.completed ? 'checked' : ''}\" \n                                 onclick=\"toggleSubtask('${taskId}', '${subtask.id}', ${JSON.stringify(currentPath)}); renderTaskDetail('${taskId}')\">\n                                ${subtask.completed ? '✓' : ''}\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"task-number\">${index + 1}.</div>\n                            <div class=\"task-content\">\n                                <div class=\"task-text ${subtask.completed ? 'completed' : ''}\">${subtask.title}</div>\n                                <div class=\"task-deadline\">\n                                    ${subtask.deadline ? new Date(subtask.deadline).toLocaleDateString() : 'No deadline'}\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <button class=\"toggle-btn\" onclick=\"toggleSubtasks('${subtask.id}')\">\n                                ${hasSubtasks ? '▼' : '+'}\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"subtasks\" id=\"subtasks-${subtask.id}\">\n                            ${hasSubtasks ? renderSubtasks(subtask.subtasks, taskId, currentPath) : ''}\n                            <button class=\"add-subtask-btn\" onclick=\"showSubtaskModal({id: '${subtask.id}', subtasks: []})\">\n                                + Add Subtask\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                `;\n            }).join('');\n        }\n\n        function toggleSubtasks(subtaskId) {\n            const subtasksDiv = document.getElementById(`subtasks-${subtaskId}`);\n            if (subtasksDiv) {\n                subtasksDiv.classList.toggle('show');\n            }\n        }\n\n        // Event listeners\n        document.getElementById('taskForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e) {\n            e.preventDefault();\n            \n            const title = document.getElementById('taskTitle').value;\n            const description = document.getElementById('taskDescription').value;\n\n            if (currentTaskId) {\n                updateTask(currentTaskId, { title, description });\n                renderTaskDetail(currentTaskId);\n            } else {\n                createTask(title, description);\n                renderTasks();\n            }\n            \n            closeModal();\n        });\n\n        document.getElementById('subtaskForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e) {\n            e.preventDefault();\n            \n            const title = document.getElementById('subtaskTitle').value;\n            const deadline = document.getElementById('subtaskDeadline').value;\n\n            if (currentParentTask) {\n                createSubtask(currentParentTask, title, deadline);\n                renderTaskDetail(currentTaskId);\n            }\n            \n            closeModal();\n        });\n\n        // Close modal when clicking outside\n        document.addEventListener('click', function(e) {\n            if (e.target.classList.contains('modal')) {\n                closeModal();\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>","version_uuid":"b075d7db-11ef-4750-b8b6-861377c40d6e"},"result":{"name":"artifacts","isError":false,"hidden":false,"parts":[{"t":"text","text":"OK"}],"extra":[],"matched":true}},{"k":"text","md":"I've created a comprehensive task breakdown website with Apple's design aesthetic. Here are the key features:\n\n## Main Features:\n\n### 🏠 **Home Page**\n- Clean grid layout showing all tasks\n- Each task card displays title, creation date, and progress bar\n- Create, edit, and delete buttons for each task\n- Floating \"Create New Task\" button\n\n### 📋 **Task Detail Page**\n- **Title & Description**: Editable task information\n- **Dates**: Shows created and last modified dates\n- **Statistics**: Multi-level task counts (total and completed for each level)\n- **Progress Visualization**: Progress bars for each task level\n- **Nested Task System**: Unlimited nesting levels\n\n### 🎯 **Nested Task System**\n- **Numbered Lists**: Each task/subtask is automatically numbered\n- **Todo Functionality**: Checkboxes to mark tasks complete (with strikethrough)\n- **Toggle Lists**: Expandable/collapsible subtask sections\n- **Deadlines**: Optional deadline setting for each task/subtask\n- **Priority Order**: Tasks maintain their hierarchical order\n\n### 🎨 **Apple Design Elements**\n- **Glassmorphism**: Frosted glass effects with backdrop blur\n- **Smooth Animations**: Hover effects and transitions\n- **Modern Typography**: SF Pro-style font stack"}],"attachments":[],"toolResults":[],"toolResultOnly":false,"files":[],"parent":"bc9cf14d-a5c3-43bb-b51d-158fca9d4241"}]}